  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: UpdatedAbilityDescriptions_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d4796c32e9219d742a267c25e6354633, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 78470532214784
    m_Localized: Chill enemies to the bone, making them unable to move or attack
      for a short time. A frozen foe knocked into a wall will be SHATTERED, receiving
      damage untold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78528635908096
    m_Localized: Freezing a low health enemy causes them to be instantly SHATTERED,
      executing the enemy. Execute threshold increases with level. Chilling!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78550739890176
    m_Localized: Leave behind a corrosive quagmire that saps the health of any foe
      foolish enough to enter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78578443268096
    m_Localized: "The poison persists even after an enemy has left the affected area,
      the damage dealt increasing with level. Put them out of their misery\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78606972923904
    m_Localized: Unleash an affliction that eats away at enemy defences. Those affected
      receive a additional damage for every weaken applied. Ouch!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78631467659264
    m_Localized: The sickness spreads! Weakened enemies give off a dull weaken effect
      when attacked, in an area that increases with  level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79172524486656
    m_Localized: "Launch three missiles at every enemy caught within the spell. If
      the target perishes before a missile can land, it seeks a new victim\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79208742301696
    m_Localized: 'Each missile strikes an additional enemy other than their target
      and explodes on impact. Missile speed, range and additional targets increase
      with level. No one is safe! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79244217724928
    m_Localized: 'Sap enemy speed and make their movement sluggish! Each effect slows
      foes further. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79262727188480
    m_Localized: Blow a bubble that slows foes and projectiles caught inside. Its
      lifetime increases with level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79769508163584
    m_Localized: Summon spikes that orbit you and hurt those that dare come close!
      All current Spikes become briefly unbreakable whenever Spikes is rolled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79837527191552
    m_Localized: Flying Spikes will stick to foes and prickle them until death, dealing
      damage that increases with level. Upon a Spikes HEAVY ATTACK, any orbiting
      spikes will fly! These stick to foes or remain to be launched again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79286106238976
    m_Localized: Conjure a black hole that draws enemies in, then explodes! Affected
      foes are damaged and knocked back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79314216464384
    m_Localized: Black holes absorb damage and afflictions from you and your opponents, 
      this accumulation is unleashed when it explodes. Its range and damage absorbtion
      increase with level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79338631507968
    m_Localized: Send foes flying with incredible force! Those knocked back receive
      further damage when SLAMMED into walls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79361427550208
    m_Localized: Summon a personal forcefield that persists for a short time and
      knocks back enemies it touches, increasing SLAMMED damage with level. And look
      out! Foes sent flying will collide with others and release a damaging shockwave
      when SLAMMED.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
